OL,3,GNEWSACharles and Camilla to officially
OL,4,Aopen Senedd as royals visit Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III and Queen Camilla are
OL,7,Fin Cardiff to officially open the new
OL,8,Fterm of the Senedd, Wales' parliament
OL,10,FIt is the seventh ceremonial opening of
OL,11,Fthe parliament since law-making powers
OL,12,Fwere devolved to Wales in 1999
OL,14,FThe King will take part in the ceremony
OL,15,Ffor the first time since he became
OL,16,Fmonarch
OL,18,FIt is also the first opening of a
OL,19,FSenedd term since Plaid Cymru became
OL,20,FWales' largest party and took over the
OL,21,Frunning of its government
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
